          "message": {
            "text": "Exact phase rows pin non-zero fractional origins and independent fragment restarts; existing skip-ink rows prove clipping does not restart the wave. The focused 71-test unit matrix passed, and the one-fixture macOS and Linux visuals both passed with zero regions.",
            "markdown": "Exact phase rows pin non-zero fractional origins and independent fragment restarts; existing skip-ink rows prove clipping does not restart the wave. The focused 71-test unit matrix passed, and the one-fixture macOS and Linux visuals both passed with zero regions."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/decoration-emit.test.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 220,
                  "endLine": 246,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  it(\"anchors exact phase at a non-zero physical fragment origin\", () => {\n    const c = gapCtx(\"wavy\", []);\n    c.segX = 17.25;\n    c.subSegments = () => [{ x0: 17.25, x1: 72.25 }];\n    const out = emitDecorationLine(20, 2, \"underline\", false, c);\n    expect(out).toContain(\"M 17.25 23.5\");\n    const ends = [...out.matchAll(/ C [^ ]+ [^ ]+ [^ ]+ [^ ]+ ([^ ]+) 23.5/g)].map((m) => Number(m[1]));\n    expect(ends.slice(0, 3)).toEqual([28.25, 39.25, 50.25]);\n  });\n\n  it(\"restarts at each painted fragment origin, not an ancestor decorating-box origin\", () => {\n    const first = gapCtx(\"wavy\", []);\n    first.segX = 12;\n    first.subSegments = () => [{ x0: 12, x1: 45 }];\n    const split = gapCtx(\"wavy\", []);\n    split.segX = 53;\n    split.subSegments = () => [{ x0: 53, x1: 86 }];\n    expect(emitDecorationLine(20, 2, \"underline\", false, first)).toContain(\"M 12 23.5\");\n    expect(emitDecorationLine(20, 2, \"underline\", false, split)).toContain(\"M 53 23.5\");\n  });\n\n  it(\"centerline sits at yTop + (t+1) + 0.5 for underline, stroked at the resolved thickness\", () => {\n    // yTop 20, t 2: centerline y 23.5; the cubic's endpoints sit ON the\n    // centerline (M x y with y = 23.5), stroke-width 2.\n    const out = emitDecorationLine(20, 2, \"underline\", false, ctx(\"wavy\"));\n    expect(out).toContain(\"M 0 23.5\");\n    expect(attr(out, \"stroke-width\")).toEqual([\"2\"]);"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
